# Anchored to the repository root, all three of them. An unanchored `gen/`
# matches a directory named gen at any depth -- which silently excluded the
# whole of protobuf/digitalbuildings/electrical/gen/ (ELECTRICAL/GEN, the
# generator) from the repository while `just ci` passed on the working tree.
/gen/
/build/
/schema/
descriptors.binpb
